        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DASH95, Floor Spring Hinge Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana double action Floor Spring Hinge Set includes <a href=\"/products/top-pivot-for-deltana-dash95-floor-spring-hinge\">top pivot</a>, side plates, back plate, and wood screws. Double action spring hinges are typically used on restaurant doors or bar doors that open in both directions and require self closing. Cover and side trim plates are solid brass, available in 11 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DASH95-floor-hinge.gif?v=1704354668\" width=\"580\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DASH95 Floor Spring Hinge\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/products/floor-spring-hinge-cover-plate-deltana-dashcp\">cover trim plates</a> and <a href=\"/products/back-plate-for-double-action-spring-hinge-deltana-dashbp\">back trim plate</a> are solid brass, available in 9 different finishes. Built in hold open feature allows the door to stay in the open position at approximately 85 degrees in both directions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis floor spring hinge is for use on 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors up to 90 pounds. Adjustable tension spring  allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). Includes adjustment tool. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DASH95 Floor Spring Hinge Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spring Hinge: 9-1/4\" Long</li>\r\n<li>Cover Plate Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cover Plate Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: 90 Lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearing Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Double-acting (swings in both directions)</li>\r\n<li>Holds open at 85 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li>1 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DASH95.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DASH95 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOptional <a href=\"/products/jamb-bracket-deltana-dash95-floor-spring-hinge\">JB-DASH95 Jamb Mounting Bracket</a>. Allows you to bolt the hinge to the bracket instead of the floor. The bracket is mounted to the door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set</b> (Enough to do one door).\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Floor Spring Hinge Set, Deltana DASH95",
                "description": "Deltana DEL-DASH95 - Deltana double action Floor Spring Hinge Set  includes  top pivot, side plates, back plate, and wood screws. Double action spring hinges are typically used on restaurant doors or bar doors that open in both directions and require self closing. Cover and side trim plates are solid brass, available in 11 different finishes.",
